{% block main %}
    <h1>Are you a student in halls of residence?</h1>
    <p>If you live in halls of residence, we need your help to test how the census works for students.
Taking part helps us make sure the census is easy to complete and produces accurate information about students living across England and Wales.</p>
    <p>The test should only take a few minutes to complete. You will need a UK mobile phone to receive an access code.</p>
    <p class="ons-u-mb-no"><strong>Start the census test by requesting your access code.</strong></p>
    {{
        onsButton({
            "text": "Start census test",
            "classes": "ons-u-mt-l",
            "url": pageInfo.rootPath + "/address.html"
        })
    }}
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-3xl">What you need to do</h2>
    {{
        onsList({
            "element": "ol",
            "itemsList": [
                {
                    "text": "Request your access code."
                },
                {
                    "text": "Receive code on a UK mobile phone."
                },
                {
                    "text": 'Use the code to access the <a href="#0">census test</a>.'
                },
                {
                    "text": "Complete the test by March 21 2027."
                }
            ]
        })
    }}
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">Why you should complete the test</h2>
    <p>The census helps build a picture of the population. Information from the census is used to help plan and fund services that people rely on, including:</p>
    {{
        onsList({
            "classes": "ons-u-mb-xl",
            "itemsList": [
                {
                    "text": "healthcare"
                },
                {
                    "text": "transport"
                },
                {
                    "text": "education"
                },
                {
                    "text": "housing"
                },
                {
                    "text": "local services"
                }
            ]
        })
    }}
    <p>Students are an important part of the population. By taking part in this test, you're helping us make sure future censuses work well for everyone.</p>
    <p>Your answers are kept confidential and used for statistical purposes.</p>
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">Which address should you use?</h2>
    <p>For the census, we want to know where people usually live.</p>
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">If you live in halls of residence during term time</h2>
    <p>Use your term-time address (your halls of residence) if that's where you usually live while studying.</p>
    <p>Even if you regularly return to your family home during holidays, your halls will usually be your census address if you spend most of your time there during term.</p>
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">If you live in private accommodation</h2>
    <p>If your term-time address is a private flat or house you should use that address. You will receive a letter to that address with an access code and a link to start your census.</p>
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">If you live at home while studying</h2>
    <p>If you normally live at your family home and commute to university, use your home address. You will receive a letter to your home address with an access code and a link to start your census.</p>
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">If you’re unsure</h2>
    <p>In most cases, students living in halls during term should use their term-time address.</p>
    <p>If you're unsure which address to use, choose the address where you spend most of your time.</p>
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">International students</h2>
    <p>If you're an international student and expect to stay in the UK for around 3 months or more, you should take part in the census test using your UK term-time address.</p>
    <p>If you'll be in the UK for less than 3 months, you do not need to complete the census test.</p>
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">Before you start</h2>
    <p>You will need:</p>
    {{
        onsList({
            "itemsList": [
                {
                    "text": "your access code"
                },
                {
                    "text": "your halls or home address"
                },
                {
                    "text": "a few minutes to complete the test"
                }
            ]
        })
    }}
    <h2 class="ons-u-mt-2xl">Need help?</h2>
    <p>If you're not sure whether you should take part, which address to use, or need help accessing the test, <a href="#0">contact the census support team</a>.</p>
{% endblock %}
